r_id": 48742, "client_id": 625301, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/380e52e2/uploads/origins/cececa65-11f3-40dd-b8f0-68b58cc32448?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8751e65261f8a24b3532efe83555191b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/380e52e2/uploads/origins/cececa65-11f3-40dd-b8f0-68b58cc32448?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=24a568c94d242555aae2088ef18bec1b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。あなたのアートワークが大好きです。とても美しいです!🥰お願いがあります。\n\n私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？ポーズや表情にこだわりはありませんので、お好きなように描いてください。普段はシャイですが、ハッピーなところもある子です。\n\nリクエストに応えていただき、ありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I2DJhmBuA3AiVc3-tcZaP9lzxLSzlgxh?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/35", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 1656340, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3322b36e/uploads/origins/241b5238-dfd8-46f8-9621-43240a31f2ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=610458cb20fbb8e35109ac3a728499d9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3322b36e/uploads/origins/241b5238-dfd8-46f8-9621-43240a31f2ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b8cd126b485f3c292afd6627f6218142", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, your artworks are really pretty!\nI would like to request my FFXIV character \"Kirima\"\nI would like a graceful or cool expression/attitude, but I will leave the pose up to you.\nWeapon is optional!\n\nThank you!\n\nReference: https://imgur.com/a/X1oqKgZ", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/34", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e95fa75f/uploads/origins/c6b8ed3c-3a8b-49e1-b986-34c3af7a33ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa3ed90019d8a519b153ea33415532ee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e95fa75f/uploads/origins/c6b8ed3c-3a8b-49e1-b986-34c3af7a33ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb14ba0d7a445a0682b4e04689123198", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。私のFFXIV OCがアルバムに含まれるアートにあるような服を着ている依頼をお願いできないかと思いました。冒険の旅に出るようなイメージです。ポーズやスタイル、背景の選択はお任せします。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Te608ek", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 910175, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2b88f35/uploads/origins/59b17f93-c757-41d7-af10-5b3f3f77cbd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbac9468cd82ef6a0d3a9a666931c39f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d2b88f35/uploads/origins/59b17f93-c757-41d7-af10-5b3f3f77cbd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a492579ddda0d417b79adb72142013ce", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi Tachi,\n\nThank you for doing all my requests could you draw another request of my other character. Any pose or outfit is fine. She has a calm and kind personality. Like Blue Morpho butterflies and Higanbana and roses. Any pose or outfit up to you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/bRq5DOS", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/32", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 1819133, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a9b2794/uploads/origins/4bab2c85-c996-495c-b477-e8aaf4fdae6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef512a68f73d399d145df434f42d69e8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a9b2794/uploads/origins/4bab2c85-c996-495c-b477-e8aaf4fdae6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3fb59f6ee89f448bfa5c2b79bdf214fe", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お世話になっております！\nイラストのリクエストをさせていただきます！\n\nイラストはブログのアイキャッチに使いたいので、イラストに対して編集・加筆・修正はしませんが、法と常識の範囲内で透過素材的に利用するので、もしそういった利用がNGなら却下してください！\n\nff14の自キャラを描いて欲しいのですが、トームストーン(スマホ)を愛でながらビールを飲んでちょっと酔っ払ってる感じでお願いできますでしょうか！背景は無しで大丈夫です！\n資料として自キャラと参考程度のおおまかなイメージをお送りします！(外部URL)\n\n1200×630pxの長方形のバナーの横らへんに配置してもぼやけない程度の解像度だと嬉しいです(が、なんでも大丈夫です！)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/c6HRRSs", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/31", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 1206869, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/48eef25f/uploads/origins/bfe5b216-7476-4fc2-9582-b538760e7ade?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d4f893b8e7cb4a6f69a72e1351555af", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/48eef25f/uploads/origins/bfe5b216-7476-4fc2-9582-b538760e7ade?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=2