ion:\nPose】：any pose is fine maybe something that would fit their personalities. They are both in love with each other.\n\nThank you for looking at my request. This is my first time sending a skeb request I'm new so I'm sorry if I'm not doing this right.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 1088531, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0a461dd/uploads/origins/30bec18d-cd12-4e98-ab2b-1c93afd74ead?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc9ba10042fe12116cca80c45bb25a8b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0a461dd/uploads/origins/30bec18d-cd12-4e98-ab2b-1c93afd74ead?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4cde6906ddfc935f0e81e095d29dfd68", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！（笑私のff14のキャラクターの絵を描いてほしいです。彼はオーラです。性格はちょっと不機嫌です。ポーズや表情はお任せします。できれば、暗くて燃えるような感じにしたいです。宜しくお願いします。\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/7TWp66yJcVhxEYes6", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tachi_hayami/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48742, "client_id": 807067, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43101885/uploads/origins/a2885962-55c1-4576-82a9-c452c7f917c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f3a30a2e586a5a0ed2876b4c38d245f1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/43101885/uploads/origins/a2885962-55c1-4576-82a9-c452c7f917c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&